# Architecture

Observatory is a Nuxt DevTools module. Capture happens in the **host app**. The iframe only renders snapshots.

| Layer | Path | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Contracts | `src/types/snapshot.ts`, `src/types/rpc.ts` | Shared entry shapes and `IObservatorySnapshot` |
| Registry | `src/runtime/composables/*-registry.ts` | Host store; expose `getSnapshot()` and call `bumpSnapshotRevision()` |
| Transform | `src/transforms/` | Optional Vite rewrite that calls into a registry |
| Plugin | `src/runtime/plugin.ts` | Register trackers, build snapshot, `import.meta.hot.send` |
| Module | `src/module.ts`, `src/env-options.ts` | Feature flags, env defaults, Vite plugins, RPC |
| Client store | `client/src/stores/observatory.ts` | `applySnapshot` into refs |
| Client UI | `client/src/views/`, `client/src/App.vue` | Tab + panel |
| Playground | `playground/` | Demo host app only |

Do not capture host-app state inside the iframe. Do not add a second snapshot channel. Alias registry keys in `SNAPSHOT_KEY_ALIASES` when the registry key differs from the snapshot field (`stateCookie` → `stateCookies`).
